@baseUrl = http://localhost:5180

### Registrar la recepción
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/access-points
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "REC-01",
  "name": "Recepción principal",
  "kind": "Reception",
  "location": "Sede principal, piso 1"
}

### Registrar el parqueadero
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/access-points
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "PARQ-01",
  "name": "Parqueadero sótano",
  "kind": "Parking",
  "location": "Sede principal, sótano 1"
}

### Registrar la bodega
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/access-points
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "BOD-01",
  "name": "Bodega de despachos",
  "kind": "Warehouse",
  "location": "Bloque B"
}

### Código repetido: 409
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/access-points
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "rec-01",
  "name": "Otra recepción",
  "kind": "Reception",
  "location": "Piso 2"
}

### Listar solo los habilitados
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/access-points?isEnabled=true&page=1&pageSize=10

### Listar por tipo
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/access-points?kind=Warehouse

### Deshabilitar un punto (reemplace el id)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/access-points/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/disable

### Volver a habilitarlo
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/access-points/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/enable
